  "term": "encephalon",
  "definition": "Encephalon is the portion of the central nervous system located within the skull. In development it arises from the neural tube and includes forebrain, midbrain, and hindbrain regions; in the mature state it includes the cerebrum, cerebellum, and brainstem structures.",
